                     "title":  "Role of biogenic CO2 in refiery decarbonization. A case study of Colombian refineries",
                     "doi":  "10.5281/zenodo.15476366",
                     "publication_date":  "2025-05-20",
                     "description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-GB\"\u003eThe repository contains supplementary information of the paper titled: Role of biogenic CO2 in refienry decarbonization. A colombian refinery case study. The information includes\u0026nbsp; technoeconmic paramters of tehcnologies used, process data for cleaning, capture and processing CO2 modelled in Aspen Plus v12 and\u0026nbsp; Aspen Hysys V14 and system modelle in Linny-r. Information is presented in pdf file, linny-r model archive and\u0026nbsp; process simulation data is presented in the form of an Excel file, which includes details of the process, a process flow diagram, and mass and energy balance information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e",
